    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.2064208984375,
        259.7042236328125,
        339.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 3: C-reactive protein",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4223022460938,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "CRP is an indicator of general inflammation that can be measured using point-of-care tests performed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.425537109375,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "on capillary blood collected via finger prick. The evidence reviewed for the performance of CRP",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.4221801757812,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "included six studies from Kenya, South Africa and Uganda with a total of 3971 participants. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4334106445312,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "average unweighted prevalence of TB among participants in the studies was 14%, ranging from 1%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        108.72809600830078,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "to 26%.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.43212890625,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Data on the accuracy of CRP using a cut-off value of > 5 mg/L and of > 10 mg/L as indicators of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.4244384765625,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "TB disease were reviewed and both cut-offs were considered to have similar or superior accuracy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.421142578125,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "when compared with the W4SS. The cut-off of > 5 mg/L was recommended because it is the lowest",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.4015502929688,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "threshold indicating abnormality in many clinical settings, and it has higher sensitivity than the cut-off",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4190063476562,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "of > 10 mg/L. The choice of cut-off will depend on the type of CRP technology available in a given",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4573974609375,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "setting, the prevalence of TB and of other conditions that may increase CRP and the preference for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        271.00787353515625,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "increased sensitivity or increased specificity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.4212036132812,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The IPD meta-analysis on CRP using a cut-off of > 5 mg/L reported similar sensitivity to and higher",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4190063476562,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "or similar specificity to the W4SS in all subpopulations assessed (see Table 2.2). When combined with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.3683471679688,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the W4SS and used in parallel, whereby a positive screen for either tool led to a diagnostic test, it was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.4135131835938,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "found to have similar or higher sensitivity and specificity to the W4SS for all populations, depending",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4410400390625,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "on the cut-off threshold used and the subpopulation assessed. CRP was found to be most accurate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.3947143554688,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "among outpatients who were not on ART, compared with the W4SS alone, which had a sensitivity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.4200439453125,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "of 0.84 (95% CI: 0.75–0.90) and specificity of 0.37 (95% CI: 0.25–0.50) in this subpopulation. When",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.43994140625,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "performed sequentially after a positive W4SS among people living with HIV not on ART, CRP with a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.424560546875,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "cut-off of > 5 mg/L was found to be as sensitive (0.84; 95% CI: 0.73–0.90) as the W4SS alone but to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.4157104492188,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "have significantly higher specificity (0.64; 95% CI: 0.55–0.72). Similar to the W4SS, the specificity of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4146728515625,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "CRP for TB screening among inpatients living with HIV was found to be extremely low, likely due to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        499.441650390625,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "other comorbidities that would also result in raised CRP levels and the presence of symptoms.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        329.7992858886719,
        801.2599487304688,
        553.4083862304688,
        811.8897705078125
      ],
      "text": "9 2. ﻿ Reduce the burden of TB among people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}